  S~S  A brief digression into THIS repo's metadata about managed objects, which are metadata templates files.

------------------------------------------

    The human metadata files suggested as templates by TSC LLC are provided under version control.

    The human metadata files in a repository root are based on these templates, edited per repo.
    Modify the repo instance of the template instance, where there are "[edit:" or "[delete:" markers.

------------------------------------------

   This file is contained in the template-docs repo's managed object, a directory, "\template-docs\".

        SimpleSal/template-docs                             repo name

        SimpleSal/template-docs\template-docs\              managed object

        SimpleSal/template-docs\template-docs\RELEASE       file name

   This file, after being copied and edited, is contained in any TSC LLC repo as human metadata.

        SimpleSal/<repo-name>\RELEASE

   The template-instance to repo-instance transition is a task when a SimpleSal repo is instantiated..

------------------------------------------

   A proper SimpleSal repo has metadata ABOUT the managed object,
   including when the managed object is ABOUT metadata.

        SimpleSal/template-docs\template-docs\RELEASE         template file

        SimpleSal/template-docs\RELEASE                       about the template file

------------------------------------------

